---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/src/cloud/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Stores a secret, read from standard input or from a variable of this shell, never from the command line. It applies at the environment's next deployment

Usage: set [OPTIONS] <NAME>

Arguments:
  <NAME>
          

Options:
      --from-env <VARIABLE>
          Reads the value from this environment variable instead of standard input

      --url <URL>
          Cloud origin; overrides `LEPTOSKIT_CLOUD_URL` and [cloud].url

      --json
          Prints the documented JSON result

      --org <ORG>
          Organization slug; defaults to [cloud].organization or your personal one

      --project <PROJECT>
          Project slug; defaults to [cloud].project

  -e, --environment <ENVIRONMENT>
          Environment name, for the commands about one; defaults to production

  -h, --help
          Print help
